design/firmware-f5-notes.md:48:Inputs: cells per size, architecture 17.17 (18.2 to 24.3 mAh at US 7 up to 24.7 to 32.9 mAh at US 13); recording 4.0 mA (architecture 17.15, 17.17); microphone 0.63 mA (Knowles text line 97) against 0.58 mA (F4 section 8.5); standby 0.03 mA (F4 8.5); `CHARGE_CURRENT` 15 mA (17.13); motor 80 mA running, 175 mA start (17.16); light Vf 1.767 V at 1.5 mA (17.21), Q2 0.7 ohm (sch-notes 12.1 item 20); sensitivity -26 dBFS (Knowles line 100) against -37 dBFS (`design/datasheets/mic-research/im68d128b-brief.txt` line 12); SNR 64.5 dB(A) (Knowles line 102); AOP 120 dB SPL (Knowles line 105).
design/firmware-f5-notes.md:51:- Thresholds on the smallest cell, 18.2 mAh: B15 = 15 % x 18.2 = 2.730 mAh, 2.730 / 4.1 x 60 = 40.0 min; B5 = 0.910 mAh, 13.3 min; B2 = 0.364 mAh, 5.3 min. On the largest, 32.9 mAh: B15 4.935 mAh, 72.2 min; B5 1.645 mAh, 24.1 min; B2 0.658 mAh, 9.6 min. (F4: 34 to 45, 11 to 15, 5 to 6 min at 4.0 mA.)
design/firmware-f5-notes.md:52:- Recording hours: 18.2 / 4.1 = 4.44 h; 32.9 / 4.1 = 8.02 h. Per size: US 7 4.44 to 5.93, US 8 4.71 to 6.27, US 9 4.98 to 6.63, US 10 5.24 to 6.98, US 11 5.51 to 7.34, US 12 5.76 to 7.68, US 13 6.02 to 8.02. (F4: 3.8 to 5.0.)
design/firmware-f5-notes.md:53:- Standby: 18.2 / 0.03 = 606.7 h = 25.3 days; 32.9 / 0.03 = 1,096.7 h = 45.7 days. (F4: 500 to 670 h.)
design/firmware-f5-notes.md:54:- A Plaud's 13 mA: 18.2 / 13 = 1.40 h; 32.9 / 13 = 2.53 h. (F4: 1.2 to 1.5.)
design/firmware-f5-notes.md:56:- Charge C-rate: 15 / 18.2 = 0.82 C; 15 / 32.9 = 0.46 C. With plus or minus 10 % accuracy [NPM p29]: 13.5 to 16.5 mA; 16.5 / 18.2 = 0.91 C (computed by hand from the two calc.log figures, not by the script). 1 C of the smallest cell = 18.2 mA = 18,200 µA (the build limit).
design/firmware-f5-notes.md:58:- First charge to 50 % from empty: 0.5 x 18.2 / 15 = 0.61 h; 0.5 x 32.9 / 15 = 1.10 h.
design/firmware-f5-notes.md:59:- Motor C-rates: 80 / 18.2 = 4.40 C, 175 / 18.2 = 9.62 C; 80 / 32.9 = 2.43 C, 175 / 32.9 = 5.32 C. (F4: 2.9 to 3.9 C and 6.4 to 8.6 C on 20.4 to 27.2 mAh.)
design/firmware-f5-notes.md:114:- check 17: the `current-microamp` row must name CHARGE_CURRENT, 15,000, 18.2 mAh, 0.82 C, S12 (F4: "at most 1 C", "15 to 20 mA", "32 mA").
design/firmware-evidence/f5/final_reply.md:4:1. nPM1304: `CHARGE_CURRENT` = 15,000 µA (0.82 C of 18.2 mAh); 4.35 V = BCHGVTERM value 9 [p36]; 10 % termination [p37]; charge time per size (1.21 to 2.19 h). The discharge-limit row is removed. IBATLIM is fixed at 100 mA minimum [p28 to p30]. New section 8.7 polls BCHGILIMBATACTIVE: on ACTIVE it logs, the screen goes off for 10 s, and a recording never stops. RSTCAUSE is logged at boot. In 8.4 the ship task is written after EVENTVBUSREMOVED [p116], with no timer. New sub-command SHIP_SAMPLE keeps the factory flag (61 transitions). Devicetree: 4 charger items confirmed from research-npm1304.md; every other property is TO CONFIRM (the firmware designer, from the SDK bindings).
design/firmware-evidence/f5/final_reply.md:7:4. Thresholds on 18.2 mAh: B15 40, B5 13, B2 5 min. Hours 4.4 to 8.0 across US 7 to 13.
