design/firmware-evidence/f6/broken/b2_motor_q1.md:6:1. **Measured cells** (17.26): US 7 17.6 to 23.5 mAh up to US 13 23.9 to 31.9 mAh replace the calculated cells of 17.17 (before: 18.2 to 32.9 mAh). The smallest cell is 17.6 mAh (sections 1.1, 3.1, 8.1, 8.5, 9.3, 10.5, H7, H8).
design/firmware-evidence/f6/broken/b2_motor_q1.md:7:2. **Thresholds on 17.6 mAh**: B15 39 min, B5 13 min, B2 5 min at 4.1 mA (before: 40, 13, 5 min on 18.2 mAh) (section 1.1).
design/firmware-evidence/f6/broken/b2_motor_q1.md:8:3. **Charge**: `CHARGE_CURRENT` stays 15,000 µA, 0.85 C of 17.6 mAh; the compile limit (1 C of the smallest cell) becomes 17,600 µA (before: 18,200); the charge time table follows the measured cells (section 8.1).
design/firmware-evidence/f6/broken/b2_motor_q1.md:16:4. **Battery per ring size** (architecture 17.15 and 17.17; since F6, 17.26): the measured cell is 17.6 to 23.5 mAh at US 7, 18.9 to 25.3 at US 8, 20.3 to 27.1 at US 9, 21.2 to 28.3 at US 10, 22.1 to 29.5 at US 11, 23.0 to 30.7 at US 12 and 23.9 to 31.9 mAh at US 13 (in F5, before the measurement, the calculated 18.2 to 24.3 up to 24.7 to 32.9 mAh). Minutes of every threshold use the smallest cell, 17.6 mAh (18.2 mAh before F6); every hours figure is a range across the sizes; every C-rate is recomputed (sections 1.1, 3.1, 8.1, 8.5, H7).
